  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 6th level, you construct an extradimensional subnet lounge anchored to your cyberdeck known as <strong>The Node</strong>.</p><ul><li>As an <strong>Action</strong>, you step into The Node. You can remain inside for up to <strong>2 &times; your Proficiency Bonus hours</strong> before being gently displaced to your entry point.</li><li>You can exit The Node at any time as a <strong>Bonus Action</strong>.</li><li>The Node includes a secure storage locker that can hold up to <strong>500 lbs</strong> of cargo and contraband.</li><li><strong>High-Bandwidth Expansion (11th Level)</strong>: You can bring a number of willing allies equal to your <strong>Intelligence modifier</strong> into The Node with you. While inside, your team completes a <strong>Short Rest in just 10 minutes</strong>.</li></ul>"
    },
